    "INTERFACE_GUIDE_PRESENTATION_MODE_DESCRIPTION": "將舞台放大成全螢幕顯示。",
    "INTERFACE_GUIDE_GRID_DESCRIPTION": "點一下可以顯示 ( 隱藏 ) 座標網格。",
